prophound/models/prophage/analysis/sakai_novel/exploratory/
prophound/models/prophage/analysis/sakai_novel/nt_local/
# candidate homology raw files (docs/candidate-phage-homology.md): query FASTAs, proteins, raw DIAMOND hits, Jaeger runs;
# v2_1/{regions,vog_classes}.tsv are identical to the tracked v2/ copies. PHASTEST results and scored tables stay tracked
prophound/models/prophage/analysis/candidate_homology/*.fna
